{"title":"2026 AMC 8 Regional Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Regional_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Each of the 4 rows sums to 15:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/5/935c022e4309c9c44349a7e53840ef8537ce4e7e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(4+1+3+2+1+4) = 15\\]\" width=\"220\" height=\"18\" />\nTotal sum: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/6/816eb0149a9b51f29982ab0588d0f1c0eebb7119.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[15 \\times 4 = 60\\]\" width=\"89\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>The correct answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/4/e4477be643e53cdd8e53634ffa05d320d3eaaf98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(C)}\\ 60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"54\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>~Icosahedron0288\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Regional_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Regional_Problems\" title=\"2026 AMC 8 Regional Problems\">2026 AMC 8 Regional Problems</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018032722\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.005 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.006 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 20/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensiv